0][1080,2400]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1080,2400]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,128][1080,2337]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.ScrollView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,128][988,2337]"><node index="0" text="可柰何、柰若何 —— 三份电子见证不一致：汉典古籍《史记·项羽本纪》与南京博物院「二十五史」全文均作「柰」，识典古籍所署四库全书本《史记》卷七作「奈」。古「奈何」本作「柰何」，柰、奈通用，后世通行本多写「奈」。本仓从两份见证作「柰」。⚠ 三份均未目验影像，不排除其中两份的转录同出一源。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,128][944,504]" /><node index="1" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,529][153,581]" /><node index="2" text="力㧞山兮 —— 识典古籍所署四库全书本作「㧞」，是「拔」的异体字形（影印 OCR 的呈现），不作异文看。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,529][944,773]" /><node index="3" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,798][153,850]" /><node index="4" text="《汉书》卷三十一·陈胜项籍传的平行文本 —— 歌辞用字与《史记》相同（力拔山兮气盖世，时不利兮骓不逝。骓不逝兮可柰何！虞兮虞兮柰若何！），句读作两句均断；上下文则作「有美人姓虞氏」对《史记》「有美人名虞」、「歌数曲」对「歌数阕」、「羽泣下数行」对「项王泣数行下」。这些是叙事文字之别，不进本首正文；本库正文从《史记》。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,798][944,1672]" /><node index="5" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,1697][153,1749]" /><node index="6" text="虞姬和歌不进正文 —— 张守节正义于「美人和之」下引《楚汉春秋》：「歌曰：汉兵已略地，四方楚歌声。大王意气尽，贱妾何聊生！」今本《史记》正文不载，本库只录项羽自作之歌，不并录和歌，也不据和歌改易正文。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,1697][944,2211]" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>